 "question": "Cognizant GenC Pro (cybersecurity) technical interview. Reported web questions: **how do you link a CSS file to HTML**, **how do you navigate between tabs**, **how do you use dates or calendars in HTML**, **what is the `<canvas>` tag for**, and **the difference between ordered and unordered lists**. The exact meaning of \"navigate between tabs\" was not specified.",
